    "text": "✨ Progress update:\n\nI imported the entire catalogue of @IKEA in 3d into Interior AI after seeing someone do the same yesterday, I'll try to import more furniture brands soon to get more variety too\n\nAnyway so now you can import your home's blueprint or do a walk through video, it then rebuilds your home, and then you can redecorate it\n\nThis is now day 4 of rebuilding Interior AI now that's the models are smart enough to do 3d stuff properly, it still looks a bit clunky and all but it's going somewhere! 😊"
